                    form in <hi rendition="#italic">Pentagon Papers: Gravel Edition</hi>, vol. 11,
                    pp. 735-736.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d290-f2" n="2" xml:id="d290-f2-content">
                <p>A note on the source text summarizes this message as “Hqs guidance regarding
                    future course of action in directing the leadership in the days ahead.” The
                    message has not been found.</p>
            </note>
